#: ../../../developer/general/gsod.rst:21 6972ccbdf0ac46588197b972b0ebbead
msgid "Instructional video series"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/general/gsod.rst:25 5fd574c891064213af6261077cafaa57
msgid "Instructional video series: The project's problem"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/general/gsod.rst:30 c5205913da564a73b55ea4cb88a9e421
msgid ""
"There is user demand for high-quality, up-to-date video guides that take "
"users from zero Linux knowledge to using Qubes as a daily driver and "
"performing specific tasks inside of Qubes, but almost no such videos exist. "
"Although most of the required knowledge is documented, many users report "
"that they would prefer to watch videos rather than read text or that they "
"would find videos easier to understand and follow along with."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/general/gsod.rst:34 8cc25669aa4d41a89222e8dbf9399d60
msgid "Instructional video series: The project's scope"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/general/gsod.rst:39 b7cadf5edd294add8ff5344ee9674bee
msgid ""
"This project consists of creating a series of instructional videos that "
"satisfy the following criteria:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/general/gsod.rst:41 89f6aee25f874821b792bdd2e04b202f
msgid ""
"Prospective users who are not yet familiar with Linux or Qubes OS can easily "
"understand and follow the videos."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/general/gsod.rst:43 d69a5f7f7bf9451aa413dfadee371120
msgid ""
"The videos make a good effort to catch and keep the attention of their "
"target audience."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/general/gsod.rst:45 e355c2aa7bf64a4391f8ad859b5c310a
msgid ""
"Users can follow the videos step-by-step to install Qubes OS and accomplish "
"various tasks."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/general/gsod.rst:47 f5ec17792f504ede9de55c251dbe4eb0
msgid ""
"The videos show the actual software being used (i.e., Qubes OS and any "
"relevant software running inside of it)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/general/gsod.rst:49 d318713693944fd78013b58c0d6594e2
msgid ""
"The videos are technically accurate, include security warnings where "
"appropriate, and use terminology in a way that is consistent with the rest "
"of the documentation (also see the :doc:`glossary </user/reference/"
"glossary>`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/general/gsod.rst:51 9a3b37ac6f1840b3831e0ffa2c6c22ad
msgid ""
"The video series is comprehensive enough that users do not need to consult "
"the documentation or ask questions (e.g., on the forum) in order to "
"accomplish the most popular tasks and activities."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/general/gsod.rst:53 0bfbd06c6c154661abd2d04d6e381392
msgid "The videos include voice narration. (Showing the speaker is optional.)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/general/gsod.rst:55 5160d66d91424b518edb6045e69b5b11
msgid ""
"The quality of the videos is consistent with current standards regarding "
"things like editing, transitions, animations, lighting, and audio quality."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/general/gsod.rst:57 f4cada9759224cb38babf0bc5cd38981
msgid "The videos are in high definition (minimum 1080p, preferably 4k)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/general/gsod.rst:59 ba8a0387d7ad497abdec5a5384e7c905
msgid ""
"The videos are separated into a series, where each video is an appropriate "
"length and is appropriately connected to the other videos in the series."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/general/gsod.rst:61 95e616f162ec468b84463ba4bf62139c
msgid ""
"The videos are suitable for upload and sharing on popular video-sharing and "
"social-media platforms, such as YouTube and Twitter. (The account or channel "
"under which the videos are uploaded is open to discussion on platforms where "
"the Qubes OS Project does not already have a significant established "
"presence, such as YouTube.)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/general/gsod.rst:63 653d07dc65fa4dbca690e5dfd9f7e69c
msgid ""
"The videos are suitable for embedding in appropriate places in the Qubes "
"documentation. (E.g., a video on how to update Qubes OS should be "
"appropriate for appearing on the :doc:`how to update </user/how-to-guides/"
"how-to-update>` page.)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/general/gsod.rst:65 854bcc360e424c48b88986d42c73f8dc
msgid ""
"Where possible, the videos should strive to be version-independent. (For "
"example, a video explaining the template system should still be relevant "
"many releases from now if the template system has not changed.)"
msgstr ""

